msgstr "Objet"

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_appointment_poll.field_appointment_poll_slot__vote_summary
msgid ""
"The detail behind the counters. Three \"yes\" answers are not equal "
"depending on who gave them, and the screen only showed the number. The "
"asterisk marks a required attendee, as on the public page."
msgstr ""
"Le détail derrière les compteurs. Trois « oui » ne se valent pas selon qui "
"les a donnés, et l'écran ne montrait que le nombre. L'astérisque marque une "
"présence requise, comme sur la page publique."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_appointment_poll.field_appointment_poll_participant__self_signup
msgid ""
"The person came in on their own through the sign-up link; they were not "
"invited by name. They are optional, and their identity rests only on the "
"address they entered: that is why changing answers already given requires a "
"code."
msgstr ""
"La personne est entrée d'elle-même par le lien d'inscription, elle n'a pas "
"été invitée nommément. Elle est facultative, et son identité ne tient qu'à "
"l'adresse qu'elle a saisie : c'est pourquoi modifier des réponses déjà "
"données lui demande un code."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_appointment_poll.field_appointment_poll__user_id
msgid ""
"The person whose calendar provides the candidate slots and who will decide "
"at closing."
msgstr ""
"La personne dont le calendrier fournit les créneaux candidats et qui "
"tranchera à la clôture."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_appointment_poll/models/appointment_poll.py:0
msgid "The seeding guest must belong to this poll."
msgstr "L'invité qui amorce doit appartenir à ce sondage."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_appointment_poll.field_appointment_poll_participant__tz
msgid ""
"The time zone in which this person reads times. Captured from the browser "
"when they use the link, otherwise taken from their contact record. Failing "
"that, the availability calendar's, then the default time zone set in "
"Settings."
msgstr ""
"Celui dans lequel cette personne lit les heures. Capté du navigateur quand "
"elle passe par le lien, sinon repris de sa fiche de contact. À défaut, celui"
" du calendrier de disponibilité, puis le fuseau par défaut réglé dans les "
"Paramètres."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:bf_appointment_poll.constraint_appointment_poll_participant_email_unique_per_poll
msgid "This address is already invited to this poll."
msgstr "Cette adresse est déjà invitée à ce sondage."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_appointment_poll.field_appointment_poll_participant__vote_url
msgid ""
"This person's personal link. Copy it to include in your own email, or to "
"follow up with someone by hand."
msgstr ""
"Le lien personnel de cette personne. Copiez-le pour l'inclure dans votre "
"propre courriel, ou pour relancer quelqu'un de la main."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_appointment_poll/models/appointment_poll.py:0
msgid "This poll has already led to an appointment."
msgstr "Ce sondage a déjà donné lieu à un rendez-vous."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_appointment_poll/models/appointment_poll_schedule_wizard.py:0
msgid "This slot does not belong to this poll."
msgstr "Ce créneau n'appartient pas à ce sondage."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_appointment_poll.field_appointment_poll__date_opened
msgid ""
"Timestamp of when voting opened. Reminders are counted from IT, never from "
"`write_date`: the latter moves with the slightest change (a corrected "
"subject, an added slot), which would push reminders back indefinitely "
"without anyone noticing."
msgstr ""
"Horodatage de l'ouverture du vote. Les relances se comptent à partir de LUI,"
" jamais de `write_date` : ce dernier bouge au moindre changement (une "
"correction de l'objet, un créneau ajouté), ce qui repousserait les relances "
"indéfiniment sans que personne ne s'en aperçoive."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_appointment_poll.field_appointment_poll_participant__tz
msgid "Timezone"
msgstr "Fuseau horaire"

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_appointment_poll.field_appointment_poll_participant__access_token
msgid "Token"
msgstr "Jeton"

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_appointment_poll.field_appointment_poll__access_token
msgid ""
"Token of the poll itself. Each participant ALSO has their own token: that is"
" what identifies the person voting."
msgstr ""
"Jeton du sondage lui-même. Chaque participant a EN PLUS son propre jeton : "
"c'est lui qui identifie la personne qui vote."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_appointment_poll.field_appointment_poll__activity_exception_decoration
msgid "Type of the exception activity on record."
msgstr "Type d'activité d'exception enregistrée."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_appointment_poll.field_appointment_poll__send_invitations
msgid ""
"Unchecked, opening the poll emails no one: the poll becomes your link to "
"paste into your own email. Each participant's link can be copied from the "
"Participants tab."
msgstr ""
"Décoché, l'ouverture n'écrit à personne : le sondage devient votre lien à "
"coller dans votre propre courriel. Le lien de chaque participant se copie "
"depuis l'onglet Participants."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_appointment_poll.field_appointment_poll_slot__is_shortlisted
msgid ""
"Used in \"everyone proposes\" mode: you first select a few slots from the "
"overlap, and the calendar hold only covers those."
msgstr ""
"Sert en mode « chacun propose » : on retient d'abord quelques plages parmi "
"le recoupement, et la retenue d'agenda ne porte que sur celles-là."

#. module: bf_appointment_poll
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_appointment_poll.selection__appointment_poll__hold_mode__visible
